{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost","id":457834,"title":"Music of Lost","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-26T01:50:13-07:00","id":457834,"title":"Music of Lost","content":"Topic for your <b>Changeling: The Lost</b> music proposals to the mood of game. I strike in more ambient/general themes kind of music, because i like music in play that make good atmosphere, not necessary that is easily heard by the players as &quot;this cool song&quot; and break away from the game. So stick rather to music without lyrics.<br /> <br /> I found the <i>Once Upon A Time</i> TV Series OST being very good for <b>Changeling</b> - it's classical-ish, having more beautiful and omnibus peaces. Real fairy tale in sound. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here is small example of it...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5IH019-eLik\" data-code=\"5IH019-eLik\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/5IH019-eLik/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> In contrast, <i>Wolf Among Us</i> OST sounds for me <b>too weird</b> for game mood - it's just too much electronics and feel of 80s, even if the game itself is great inspiration for <b>Changeling</b>.<br /> <br /> This is how you should<b><i>not</i> done CtL</b> music...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kWMKxGXtYtQ\" data-code=\"kWMKxGXtYtQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/kWMKxGXtYtQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-26-2015, 07:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T04:13:19-07:00","id":457880,"title":"","content":"Most of Nightwish's songs fit surprisingly well with Changeling, especially as battle music.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Nightwish: I Want My Tears Back</b> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/fV2C9_MAJ0E\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/fV2C9_MAJ0E</a><br /> <br /> <b>Nightwish: The Crow, the Owl and the Dove</b> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Upt8_tPYIl0\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/Upt8_tPYIl0</a><br /> <br /> I feel like this song would be perfect for trading in the Goblin Market, or harvesting Glamour. :P<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> As does Celtic music, since fairies are often associated with such.<br /> <br /> <b>2 Hours of Celtic</b> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/jiwuQ6UHMQg\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/jiwuQ6UHMQg</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>2 Hours of Fantasy</b> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/4bhceZgdWFM\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/4bhceZgdWFM</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 03-26-2015, 07:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T04:25:18-07:00","id":457929,"title":"","content":"The Taverns of Azeroth album has good tracks. I think that the solemn violins in &quot;Temple of the Moon&quot; make it especially well suited to Changeling angst.<br /> <br /> &quot;Game of Houses&quot;, in the Wheel of Time soundtrack, has this creaky undertone of cogs turning that evokes Wizened workshops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T10:59:28-07:00","id":458155,"title":"","content":"Blind Guardian might as well be NWoD: The Metal Band<br /> <br /> Besides stuff like <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qi0akvkAYkA\" target=\"_blank\">Otherland</a> (Arcadia), <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rj-QLcJndg8\" target=\"_blank\">Another Stranger Me</a> (Fetches), and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-dc3-iyD-ro\" target=\"_blank\">Fly</a> (How do you think the Gentry get you in the first place?)... well, I'll leave you to look for yourself.<br /> <br /> A Shadow Out Of Tim is a concept album by Darkest of the Hillside Thickets based around Lovecraft's A Shadow Out of Time; despite that... well, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uDzLesQVl0w\" target=\"_blank\">Blackout</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RN9kNuDvkuM\" target=\"_blank\">No Way</a> fit rather well for... different reasons (No Way is a bit horrifying from the perspective of a Changeling trying to take their life back).<br /> <br /> Eh, I'll think of some more later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T11:17:47-07:00","id":458164,"title":"","content":"The soundtrack from <i>Pan's Labyrinth.</i><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzZgNKJxmgs\" data-code=\"qzZgNKJxmgs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/qzZgNKJxmgs/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <i>The Nightmare before Christmas.</i> Beautiful music, images of madness.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xpvdAJYvofI\" data-code=\"xpvdAJYvofI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/xpvdAJYvofI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T12:38:54-07:00","id":458262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost#post457834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In contrast, <i>Wolf Among Us</i> OST sounds for me <b>too weird</b> for game mood - it's just too much electronics and feel of 80s, even if the game itself is great inspiration for <b>Changeling</b>.<br /> <br /> This is how you should<b><i>not</i> done CtL</b> music...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kWMKxGXtYtQ\" data-code=\"kWMKxGXtYtQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/kWMKxGXtYtQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure I agree. The electronics do ground the music in the real world, but the pacing and slow swirl to the style is just as evocative of the fairy tale mists that one shouldn't go wandering through as xylophones and pipes doing the same. It's dark, creeping, and subtle,with an edge of the urban to set the scene.<br /> <br /> I think it's a marvelous piece for Changeling that can do a lot-I can just imagine one of my changeling's stumbling through the streets on an autumn night, crashing into things as the glamour pulses violet in her veins, her body tired but her mind blazing, her eyes making out the faces in the crowd, in the fog, in the mirrors, knowing they're not real, and still trying to decide if she should run anyways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T13:40:17-07:00","id":458320,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure how useful the song is as mood music in an actual game, but I defy anyone to watch the video and listen to the lyrics and not get a creepily strong Changeling vibe.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=di7NMssrqsE\" data-code=\"di7NMssrqsE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/di7NMssrqsE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T13:46:29-07:00","id":458324,"title":"","content":"I've used it!<br /> <br /> Poets of the Fall is a staple of Changeling Soundtracks period. Carnival of Rust is the theme song of Changeling the Lost and I will hear no word against it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T13:57:27-07:00","id":458329,"title":"","content":"I don't think the style of music necessarily matches the theme of changeling, however when I heard two songs in particular by this band a couple of times and heard the lyrics I did double take and wounder what exactly was she singing about? I'm sure she wasn't but these songs in particular sound awful alot like she's singing about changelings.<br /> <br /> One true thing - I'll Wait<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SucEgH1NjQE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SucEgH1NjQE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SucEgH1NjQE </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SucEgH1NjQE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SucEgH1NjQE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i>From a distance, I hear them call.<br /> For you and for me,<br /> for everything they see.<br /> On a mission, losing their minds.<br /> For love and for hate,<br /> for freedom they can\u2019t take.<br /> Your decision, you\u2019d go along.<br /> And give up your life to fight<br /> for what went wrong.<br /> <br /> And you know that I know<br /> that you won\u2019t come back again.<br /> And you know that I\u2019d go<br /> but I\u2019d lose myself in it.<br /> I\u2019ll wait into the summer and into the winter,<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you, I will.<br /> I\u2019ll hold onto you tightly and pray for you nightly.<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you.<br /> <br /> In the twilight, hours pass slow.<br /> The minutes roll by,<br /> as summer turns to snow.<br /> I decided, I\u2019m not that strong.<br /> I couldn\u2019t go out and fight<br /> what I know is wrong.<br /> <br /> And you know that I know<br /> that you won\u2019t come back again.<br /> And you know that I\u2019d go<br /> but I\u2019d lose my faith in it.<br /> I\u2019ll wait into the summer and into the winter,<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you, I will.<br /> I\u2019ll hold onto you tightly and pray for you nightly.<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ll wait into the summer and into the winter,<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you, I will.<br /> I\u2019ll hold onto you tightly and pray for you nightly.<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you, I will<br /> I\u2019ll wait into the summer and into the winter,<br /> I\u2019ll wait for you.<br /> <br /> From a distance, I hear them call.<br /> For you and for me,<br /> for everything they see.<br /> On a mission, losing their minds.<br /> For love and for hate,<br /> for freedom...</i><br /> <br /> There was another one aswell, with repeated mentions of bushes and thorns and loosing your mind.<br /> One True Thing - Will I Make It<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UABUKcDm48g\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UABUKcDm48g\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UABUKcDm48g </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UABUKcDm48g\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UABUKcDm48g </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4641-pebbles","name":"Pebbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T17:30:15-07:00","id":458503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=458324#post458324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've used it!<br /> <br /> Poets of the Fall is a staple of Changeling Soundtracks period. Carnival of Rust is the theme song of Changeling the Lost and I will hear no word against it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's actually kind of amazing that they contributed a significant amount of the soundtrack of Alan Wake, a game that was just choc full of Changeling-esque elements. Monsters who derive their power from narrative, but are bereft of creativity in their own right and must therefore rely on artists to create the story in which they play. Then there's the amoral, homicidal doppelganger with shadow-based powers. Then there's the whole &quot;being taken to another world that can only dimly be remembered, before escaping and finding oneself back in the real world to find some time has elapsed that doesn't quite match the time spent missing&quot; aspect. And then there's just the fact that the game finds an excuse to toss you into the woods at every opportunity.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Poet and the Muse&quot; would probably be a pretty great song for a more mournful sequence in a Changeling game, for that matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T19:13:30-07:00","id":458574,"title":"","content":"Since we're doing lyric songs now, Zimmer's &quot;Here I Am&quot; conveys this incredible sense of freedom and fulfilment. The opening lines are reminiscent of a Changeling who's just broken out of Faerie:<br /> <br /> <i>Here I am - this is me<br /> There's nowhere else on earth I'd rather be...</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T02:22:37-07:00","id":458764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=457880#post457880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most of Nightwish's songs fit surprisingly well with Changeling, especially as battle music.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Nightwish: I Want My Tears Back</b> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/fV2C9_MAJ0E\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/fV2C9_MAJ0E</a><br /> [/URL]</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I once conjured a particularly unpleasant Keeper called 'The Teartaker' for one of my players, based entirely on that song. Very fitting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","name":"Malkydel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T11:08:20-07:00","id":471379,"title":"","content":"It's hardly as fitting as these others here, I'll admit, but this song makes me think of a changeling lamenting their Durance - mostly the refrain. I'd love to see what inventive minds could do towards reworking this song to properly Changeling lyrics.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QO40HjRH2w\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QO40HjRH2w\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QO40HjRH2w </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QO40HjRH2w\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QO40HjRH2w </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5487-voiddrifter","name":"VoidDrifter","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T14:17:07-07:00","id":471675,"title":"","content":"Lindsey Stirling's <i>Shatter Me </i>is pretty Changeling. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=49tpIMDy9BE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=49t