div> </div><br /> <br /> This is the song of every Changeling who manages to escape and is never able to sleep peacefully again.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kIBdpFJyFkc\" target=\"_blank\">Nightwish - Nemo</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">This is me for forever</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">One of the lost ones</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">The one without a name</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Without an honest heart as compass</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">This is me for forever</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">One without a name</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">These lines the last endeavor</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">To find the missing lifeline</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Oh how I wish</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">For soothing rain</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">All I wish is to dream again</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">My loving heart</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Lost in the dark</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">For hope I'd give my everything</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">My flower, withered between</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">The pages 2 and 3</span></span><