title":"","content":"Spaceman by The Killers is my go to Changeling song<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://youtube.com/watch?v=Hc16Y9fiCvQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://youtube.com/watch?v=Hc16Y9fiCvQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://youtube.com/watch?v=Hc16Y9fiCvQ\" target=\"_blank\"> http://youtube.com/watch?v=Hc16Y9fiCvQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">It started with a low light,</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Next thing I knew they ripped me from my bed</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">And then they took my blood type</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">It left a strange impression in my head.</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">You know that I was hoping,</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">That I could leave this star-crossed world behind</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">But when they cut me open,</span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I guess I changed my mind.</span></i><br /> <br /> <br /> It falls perfectly within the modern image of the Gentry as Greys conducting abductions. Plus the music video is straight out of Arcadia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7034,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7034-momotato","user":"momotato","date":". 04-16-2016, 02:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7034-momotato","name":"momotato","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015