astic for background music with both fighting and traveling music.<br /> <br /> James Newton's scores for The Village and Maleficent are wonderful and terrible.<br /> <br /> Thomas VanOosting has a few curious and mysterious songs with renaissance feeling:<br /> The lordly ladies have arrived<br /> Alligator Dance<br /> Sweet Revenge<br /> <br /> All of the above are available on Spotify.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13128-spinnerling","name":"Spinnerling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T23:08:59-08:00","id":1174214,"title":"","content":"Am I the only one who feels that Frozen's &quot;Let It Go&quot; is unusually apt for a Changeling's experience?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=moSFlvxnbgk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=moSFlvxnbgk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=moSFlvxnbgk\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=moSFlvxnbgk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T13:10:37-08:00","id":1177665,"title":"","content":"Outside of being a cool song, Lindsey Stirling's &quot;Shadows&quot; is what I imagine a Changeling performance to be like.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGCsyshUU-A\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGCsyshUU-A\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGCsyshUU-A\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGCsyshUU-A </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-08T12:22:34-08:00","id":1183661,"title":"","content":"Another post from me, but this is a cool cover song for the opening of the anime &quot;Higurashi No Naku Koro Ni&quot;; the tone sounds like it'd be good for the perspective of a Gentry finding and playing with their Changelings...in a realm of trees, rain that turns to blood and cicadas, in a game where the Changelings must not be found by their keeper who can tear apart the darkness itself.<br /> <br /> I love it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rNhrTKQqY2A\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rNhrTKQqY2A\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rNhrTKQqY2A\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rNhrTKQqY2A </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Another cover of a Japanese song from LittleJayneycakes, this one is of &quot;Paper Moon&quot; from the second opening of Soul Eater; once again, this kind of song can be taken literally, this time of a Changeling making a vow to another person to protect their dreams (or perhaps their actual life). It's pretty awesome. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrALSITPguE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrALSITPguE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrALSITPguE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrALSITPguE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5803,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","user":"Taidragon","date":". 02-08-20