 class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSQGvnjr4Yw\" data-code=\"bSQGvnjr4Yw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/bSQGvnjr4Yw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24044-ventrue-life","name":"Ventrue Life","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24044_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T05:02:40-07:00","id":1214541,"title":"","content":"A couple songs that remind me of Changeling<br /> <br /> Lord Huron's Meet Me in the Woods<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/d5axbaGBVto\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/d5axbaGBVto\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/d5axbaGBVto\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/d5axbaGBVto </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A couple Mumford and Sons songs that just seem similar in mood <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/81DAIb6l9jI\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/81DAIb6l9jI</a><br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/sXzDu071RdQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/sXzDu071RdQ</a><br /> <br /> And lastly, Missio's Monsters, which just seems applicable to pretty much all supernaturals <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/UdQbChxCANo\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/UdQbChxCANo</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T11:17:50-07:00","id":1214689,"title":"","content":"I'm a big fan of Todrick Hall's <u>Straight Outta Oz</u> album, even though for a Wizard of Oz themed pop/hip-hop album it is weirdly low on Changeling qualities. But the music video for If I Had a Heart is a nice piece of Changeling inspo.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jkTdOjywqOs\" data-code=\"jkTdOjywqOs\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/jkTdOjywqOs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12108,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12108-gscrap","user":"gscrap","date":". 05-03-2018, 02:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12108-gscrap","name":"gscrap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12108_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-23T21:06:45-07:00","id":1256882,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:8px\">You're cold,<br /> but I know it's not your fault<br /> storm is coming now<br /> can we survive somehow?</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=osTgI-0GXxs\" data-code=\"osTgI-0GXxs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/osTgI-0GXxs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T17:55:29-07:00","id":1260053,"title":"","content":"Kingdom Hearts always has had some pretty great music to use for Changeling but the theme from Kingdom Hearts III, &quot;Don't Think Twice&quot; by Utada Hikaru, really struck me as Changeling especially with the lyrics and the tone the song gives.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r1o-Ew1fhH8\" data-code=\"r1o-Ew1fhH8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/r1o-Ew1fhH8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> How did I live<br /> In a kingdom of thieves<br /> And people who say<br /> Things they don't really mean, really mean<br /> You're only everything I ever dreamed<br /> Ever dreamed of, ever dreamed of<br /> You must be kidding me, did you really think<br /> I could say no<br /> <br /> I want you for a lifetime<br /> So if you\u2019re gonna think twice, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know<br /> Everything is just right<br /> But if you\u2019re gonna think twice, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know<br /> <br /> I really dont get<br /> What everyone else believes<br /> So why do they say<br /> Things they dont really mean? Really mean?<br /> Im only fine cause I never dreamed<br /> It'd take this long, it'd take this long<br /> <br /> I want you for a lifetime<br /> So if you\u2019re gonna think twice, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know<br /> Everything is just right<br /> But if you\u2019re gonna think twice, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know, baby<br /> I don\u2019t wanna know","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3239-jane_dargason","name":"Jane_Dargason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3239_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T04:12:42-07:00","id":1261080,"title":"","content":"The soundtrack from the swedish tv-show &quot;Jordskott&quot; fit Changeling perfectly:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=svN-AQTnX_0\" data-code=\"svN-AQTnX_0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/svN-AQTnX_0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> The show itself is also great inspiration. It is about children going missing in a spooky forest and a detective/mother to one of the children tries to find the culprit, who might not be entierly human...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15748-carrot-crusader","name":"Carrot Crusader","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T10:41:11-07:00","id":1261135,"title":"","content":"So I just stumbled across this thread and thought you might be interested in this, which is the playlist I made/listened to while editing Changeling: The Lost Second Edition, inspired by the book itself. Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/user/dixiecyanide/playlist/4pCH91oDTSrkaGHFR5HjMW?si=RU84zgw6Rmu_3TwijhVxdA\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.spotify.com/user/dixiec...Rmu_3TwijhVxdA</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>In-House Developer for <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> and <b>Exalted </b></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23832-dixiecyanide","name":"DixieCyanide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T17:01:52-07:00","id":1261202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DixieCyanide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1261135#post1261135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I just stumbled across this thread and thought you might be interested in this, which is the playlist I made/listened to while editing Changeling: The Lost Second Edition, inspired by the book itself. Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/user/dixiecyanide/playlist/4pCH91oDTSrkaGHFR5HjMW?si=RU84zgw6Rmu_3TwijhVxdA\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.spotify.com/user/dixiec...Rmu_3TwijhVxdA</a></div> </div> </div> </div>You included Haunted! I love that whole album, and I was just discussing the Changeling-y vibes of it with my husband.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-02T07:00:30-08:00","id":1278057,"title":"","content":"Folk group SHEL covering &quot;Enter Sandman&quot; works SO perfectly....<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HdPeHTdrBYQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HdPeHTdrBYQ</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5766-nouveaurich","name":"NouveauRich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5766_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T05:51:07-08:00","id":1278294,"title":"","content":"All Al