</div> </div><br /> <br /> Thanks for listening, and yes this was a horrendously gauche plug. No shame here <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div> I\u2019m fine with it. Nice stuff. Seriously cool to see someone make something Changeling as inspiration. I really enjoyed doing homework to this. Is there a particular name for the genera? Thanks for sharing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shinsoryuu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469214#post1469214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always thought that the Ba'al battle theme from <i>Bravely Default </i>would fit very well in <i>Changeling: The Lost.</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bdI6bkqDJJ4\" data-code=\"bdI6bkqDJJ4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/bdI6bkqDJJ4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that\u2019s a very interesting soundtrack. Might have to add it to my Spotify. Thank you for sharing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469218#post1469218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *shivers from flashbacks*</div> </div> </div> </div>Is that difficultly flashbacks, or horror trauma flashbacks? (Never played)(game looks cute)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T20:11:51-08:00","id":1469222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469221#post1469221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is that difficultly flashbacks, or horror trauma flashbacks? (Never played)(game looks cute)</div> </div> </div> </div>Difficulty flashbacks for the first game where two of them made a preview appearance as Lv99 optional superbosses; not so much for the second game where they were story bosses.<br /> <br /> For horror, it\u2019s honestly less \u201cI\u2019m having nightmares IRL\u201d and more \u201coh god I\u2019m glad they aren\u2019t anywhere NEAR being real\u201d<br /> <br /> I mean, look up on the Ba\u2019als designs (spoiler warnings though). Surreal as hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T21:31:53-08:00","id":1469226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469222#post1469222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Difficulty flashbacks for the first game where two of them made a preview appearance as Lv99 optional superbosses; not so much for the second game where they were story bosses.</div> </div> </div> </div> I\u2019m guessing that 99 is max level? And you don\u2019t reach max level quickly? Yikes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469222#post1469222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For horror, it\u2019s honestly less \u201cI\u2019m having nightmares IRL\u201d and more \u201coh god I\u2019m glad they aren\u2019t anywhere NEAR being real\u201d<br /> I mean, look up on the Ba\u2019als designs (spoiler warnings though). Surreal as hell.</div> </div> </div> </div> I actually might look into this game, so I\u2019m avoiding spoilers. But I already looked at the screen, so I might as well see what\u2019s already there.<br /> \u2026I\u2019m honestly not sure what I\u2019m looking at here. A bee/bird made of ribbons and globes and lights is all I\u2019m getting. Is nice and ethereal. Pretty, in it\u2019s own way. Not particularly scary to me, but I have been informed that I have weird sense of what is creepy or unnerving to other people. Surreal though, absolutely. That thing might be making a appearance in someone\u2019s dreams in my game. I don\u2019t know what it\u2019s represent though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T22:03:21-08:00","id":1469228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469226#post1469226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I\u2019m guessing that 99 is max level? And you don\u2019t reach max level quickly? Yikes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well actually you can reach max level relatively quickly at a later point in the game \u2014 the series started as a Final Fantasy series homage, after all. <br /> <br /> And true to JRPG fashion, the bosses can still beat you up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I actually might look into this game, so I\u2019m avoiding spoilers. But I already looked at the screen, so I might as well see what\u2019s already there.<br /> \u2026I\u2019m honestly not sure what I\u2019m looking at here. A bee/bird made of ribbons and globes and lights is all I\u2019m getting. Is nice and ethereal. Pretty, in it\u2019s own way. Not particularly scary to me, but I have been informed that I have weird sense of what is creepy or unnerving to other people. Surreal though, absolutely. That thing might be making a appearance in someone\u2019s dreams in my game. I don\u2019t know what it\u2019s represent though. </div> </div> </div>You\u2019re actually keen there \u2014 the bird thing is a nightmarishly garbled memory/emotion of someone\u2019s wedding, and any further\u2019s a spoiler. The creature (and its friends, the Ba\u2019als) is indeed a nice inspiration for Oneiromantic and dream-heavy True Fae shenanigans; the final boss of the game doubles down on the \u2018True Fae\u2019 part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-30T01:03:55-08:00","id":1469237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469221#post1469221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I\u2019m fine with it. Nice stuff. Seriously cool to see someone make something Changeling as inspiration. I really enjoyed doing homework to this. Is there a particular name for the genera? Thanks for sharing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br /> <br /> I would describe it as dark folk, dare I say even pagan? but most of it is synthesier as opposed to real instruments (if that matters, I don't think it does but YMMV). tt's also a bit gothic and a little bit darkwave, which, as far as I know, a more gothic form of electronic music.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25906-ghost-whistler","name":"ghost whistler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25906_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-30T14:30:10-08:00","id":1469270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469228#post1469228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well actually you can reach max level relatively quickly at a later point in the game \u2014 the series started as a Final Fantasy series homage, after all.<br /> <br /> And true to JRPG fashion, the bosses can still beat you up.</div> </div> </div> </div> I actually don\u2019t have any experience with JRPGs, outside of Pok\u00e9mon. I normally stick with WRPGs. This will be a new experience, worth the price on its own.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469228#post1469228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You\u2019re actually keen there \u2014 the bird thing is a nightmarishly garbled memory/emotion of someone\u2019s wedding, and any further\u2019s a spoiler.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you. I\u2019m not sure how keen I really was, anything that surreal was just made to be surreal or has be a symbol of something. I am intrigued by this explanation of what it is.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469228#post1469228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The creature (and its friends, the Ba\u2019als) is indeed a nice inspiration for Oneiromantic and dream-heavy True Fae shenanigans; the final boss of the game doubles down on the \u2018True Fae\u2019 part.</div> </div> </div> </div> Well, I was already going to get the game, but now I\u2019m really sold on the concept. I would normal pull inspiration from my own life and dreams, but I never remember anything of my dreams. Well except the nightmares, and I don\u2019t remember most of those anyway. And the game look good anyways. So now I need this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ghost whistler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469237#post1469237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div> No problem. Just being honest.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ghost whistler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469237#post1469237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would describe it as dark folk, dare I say even pagan? but most of it is synthesier as opposed to real instruments (if that matters, I don't think it does but YMMV). tt's also a bit gothic and a little bit darkwave, which, as far as I know, a more gothic form of electronic music.</div> </div> </div> </div> Huh. I have never heard of those before. Only really started listening to music recently, so I don\u2019t know much. Thank you.<br /> <br /> <br /> Alright, so I found more songs, partially to get the conversation back on track. Also I found these neat.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w\" target=\"_blank\">\u200b</a>Secret of Kells is a good movie, more a Acanthus than Changeling story I\u2019m afraid, but the imagery and music is just beautiful. The particular track \u201cIn the Forest\u201d has all the wonder and danger of the Hedge.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRNCT1oGy-w\" data-code=\"vRNCT1oGy-w\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/vRNCT1oGy-w/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> If you like that one, there is another film by the same people, called Song of The Sea. This one might be spinning the Hedge, by song.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oBYRGXN0ksc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oBYRGXN0ksc<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oBYRGXN0ksc\" data-code=\"oBYRGXN0ksc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/oBYRGXN0ksc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> Secrets by Oceanlab is a good one for the Chronicles of Darkness in general, but the latter half of the song is especially Changeling related. Specifically trying to reveal their nature to someone, but wanting, maybe needing, a promise first. That they will never tell anyone else.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHXZRD5fCa8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHXZRD5fCa8\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHXZRD5fCa8 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHXZRD5fCa8\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHXZRD5fCa8 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHXZRD5fCa8\" data-code=\"pHXZRD5fCa8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pHXZRD5fCa8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Edit: forgot a word. Or two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 11-30-2021, 11:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-30T19:53:12-08:00","id":1469284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/457834-music-of-lost?p=1469270#post1469270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Thank you. I\u2019m not sure how keen I really was, anything that surreal was just made to be surreal or has be a symbol of something. I am intrigued by this explanation of what it is.<br /> <br /> Well, I was already going to get the game, but now I\u2019m really sold on the concept. I would normal pull inspiration from my own life and dreams, but I never remember anything of my dreams. Well except the nightmares, and I don\u2019t remember most of those anyway. And the game look good anyways. So now I need this.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>One last note; Bravely Default, and Bravely Second, are two different games (with the latter being the sequel) \u2014 the Baals appear properly in the latter (and in the former, only as optional content). Their plots are directly continuous, but as far as I remember you don\u2019t <i>need</i> to play the first game to know what the second is doing (though it obviously helps).<br /> Saying this juuust in case you buy the first game only, only to get confused because you don\u2019t see the Baals. <br /> <br /> (And I swear this is the last time I get off-topic here)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-13T08:33:22-08:00","id":1470346,"title":"","content":"I like to use